==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[crash]] [[course]]}}

# {{idiomatic}} A [[quick]], [[intense]] course of [[learning]], especially one which is [[informal]] or [[hurried]].
#:''He got a '''crash course''' in babysitting when his sister dropped off his nephew for the afternoon.''

